  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SPA Partner Dialogue Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within the Strategic Partnerships 2022-2025 (SPA2) with Danish CSO&#x2019;s, the aim is to introduce a new type of strategic dialogue tool: the SPA Partner Dialogues. The purpose is to take the strategic dialogue with SPA organisations out of Copenhagen and HQ and to the country level and the local partners of the SPA organisations. They will be held in relevant countries where are number of organisations have local partners. 

The first pilot meeting is planned to take place in Uganda in the beginning of September, where 13 out of the 18 strategic partners have programmes in Uganda.</narrative>
  </description>
